        "content_writing": "<p><em><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>The diagram below describes the structure of a home smokery and how it works. </strong></span><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">IELTS Writing Task 1 - Home Smokery Structure and Process</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i Home Smokery Structure and Process y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả Hệ thống hun kh&oacute;i tại nh&agrave;.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Home Smokery Structure and Process với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh sản hun kh&oacute;i c&aacute; tại nh&agrave; - c&aacute; sẵn s&agrave;ng để b&aacute;n.</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề Process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Quy tr&igrave;nh n&agrave;y bao gồm 3 bước</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2VPdMAvPoFqkkxqptzlZnh8gMb\" data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">bắt đầu bằng <strong>việc dẫn kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute; v&agrave;o</strong> <em>(fresh air input)</em></span><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><em>&nbsp;</em>v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c khi&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">c&aacute; được hun kh&oacute;i trong hộp</span></strong><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;<em>(smoked fish in box)</em>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA9Wd4PctodTUwxgjellSqICgId\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> <strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">M&ocirc; tả c&aacute;c bước đầu của quy tr&igrave;nh (Chuẩn bị v&agrave; Tạo kh&oacute;i)</span></strong></strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QRDzd5pRaow8VbxJ5AvlENkBgHe\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute; sạch được h&uacute;t v&agrave;o hệ thống</strong> <em>(fresh air enters the system)</em> th&ocirc;ng qua lối dẫn kh&iacute; c&oacute; thể <strong>điều chỉnh bằng cơ chế đ&oacute;ng mở nắp</strong> <em>(controlled by a lid mechanism)</em>.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Olr7d0R1yoweOcxTQDjlZGSLgHf\" data-list=\"bullet\">Kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute; n&agrave;y <strong>chảy xuống dưới</strong> <em>(flows downward)</em> v&agrave;o <strong>buồng đốt nằm dưới l&ograve;ng đất</strong><em> (underground fire chamber)</em> nơi gỗ được đốt để <strong>tạo ra kh&oacute;i v&agrave; nhiệt </strong><em>(generate smoke and heat)</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: <strong class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">M&ocirc; tả c&aacute;c bước c&ograve;n lại của quy tr&igrave;nh (Hun kh&oacute;i c&aacute;)</span></strong></strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WUi4dECVWodeH6xDzW5lfGCUg6e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Kh&oacute;i được dẫn l&ecirc;n</strong> <em>(smoke is channeled upward)</em> th&ocirc;ng qua ống nối đến <strong>khu vực hun kh&oacute;i ở mặt đất </strong><em>(ground-level smoking box)</em> nơi c&aacute; được đặt sẵn.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XTD7d1uAjoQvwkxaM9plVbFnghe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">Cuối c&ugrave;ng, <strong>kh&oacute;i bao quanh c&aacute;</strong> <em>(smoke circulates around the fish)</em> trong khu vực đ&oacute;ng, v&agrave; qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh hun kh&oacute;i ho&agrave;n tất tạo ra <strong>c&aacute; hun kh&oacute;i sẵn s&agrave;ng cho việc chế biến</strong> <em>(smoked fish ready for consumption).</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
